                <pb facs="0028" n="22" xml:id="pg22"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Sill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 14.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-22"><hi rendition="#italic">June 22,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In view of the friendly interest of the United States in the welfare of Korea and
                    its people, you are, by direction of the President, instructed to use every
                    possible effort for the preservation of peaceful conditions.</p>
            </div>
